questions.solution:
**Given:**

Find the value of sqrt{125 + sqrt{344 + sqrt{289}}}.

**Formula used:**

Step-by-step simplification using square roots.

**Calculation:**

sqrt{125 + sqrt{344 + sqrt{289}}}

⇒ sqrt{125 + sqrt{344 + 17}}

⇒ sqrt{125 + sqrt{361}}

⇒ sqrt{125 + 19}

⇒ √144

⇒ 12

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**
